### GET user
GET http://localhost/collections/users/records/1
Accept: application/json

### POST new user
POST http://localhost/collections/users/records
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "firstname": "Пётр",
  "lastname": "Иванов",
  "secondname": "Петрович",
  "datebirthday": "1999-01-01",
  "gender": "мужской",
  "email": "ivanov@matule.ru",
  "password": "123456"
}

### AUTH
POST http://localhost/collections/users/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identity": "ivanov@matule.ru",
  "password": "123456"
}

